OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers left 'stranded' as
OL,4,Aroadworks block buses
OL,5,
OL,6,FVillagers said they would be left
OL,7,Fstranded without a bus service for
OL,8,Fnearly two weeks due to roadworks.
OL,10,FCityFibre is planning to dig up a
OL,11,Fsection of Stalham Road in Sea Palling,
OL,12,FNorfolk to install new cables between 2
OL,13,FNovember and 13 November.
OL,15,FBus firm Sanders Coaches said it would
OL,16,Fbe "unachievable" to serve the remote
OL,17,Fcoastal village during this time as a
OL,18,Fdiversion would add nearly 32 miles
OL,19,F(51km) and 85 minutes to the journey
OL,20,Ftime.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
