OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers left 'stranded' as
OL,4,Aroadworks block buses
OL,5,
OL,6,FResident Wendy Dickson, 59, said it had
OL,7,Fcaused a great deal of stress and would
OL,8,Fmake it hard for her disabled daughter
OL,9,FKeila to attend hospital appointments.
